srem4: x % 4, for x from -999 to 999, with the sign of x. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-23, with x in cell 90 and a scratch cell t0 in cell 91.
Copy cells 10-23 to where the program needs x % 4, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x and each 91 to a free cell; the program goes on with x % 4 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator and t0; x is kept.
Size 15 cells (14 instructions and t0). It runs 14 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-18: 25x; its last two digits, 25 times the remainder, kept by SFT 22
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     410      SFT 10
 13     290      ADD 90
 14     290      ADD 90
 15     290      ADD 90
 16     290      ADD 90
 17     290      ADD 90
 18     422      SFT 22
 19     691      STO 91   cells 19-23: times 4, divided by 100
 20     291      ADD 91
 21     291      ADD 91
 22     291      ADD 91
 23     402      SFT 02
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
 91     000      data: t0, scratch
